sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as Caller / GaRunner
    participant NStore as HilbertNeighborStore
    participant KeyGen as HilbertKeyGenerator
    participant Lead as LeadStore (GrpcLeadStore)
    participant Euclid as EuclideanDistance

    Note over Caller,Lead: 1. Multi-Probe Store (3 rotated Hilbert curves)
    Caller->>NStore: store(genes, fitness, generation)
    NStore->>NStore: serde_json::to_string(&GenePayload)
    NStore->>KeyGen: keys_for(genes)
    KeyGen-->>NStore: keys (3 rotated Hilbert curve keys)
    loop for each key in keys
        NStore->>Lead: store_gene(key, value)
        Lead-->>NStore: Ok(())
    end
    NStore-->>Caller: Ok(())

    Note over Caller,Euclid: 2. Multi-Probe k-NN Query & Euclidean Re-ranking
    Caller->>NStore: query_knn(query, k)
    NStore->>KeyGen: keys_for(query)
    KeyGen-->>NStore: probe_keys (3 probe keys)
    loop for each probe_key in probe_keys
        NStore->>Lead: range_query(probe_key, k)
        Lead-->>NStore: Vec<(key, json_payload)>
        NStore->>NStore: parse GenePayload & deduplicate into candidates map
    end

    loop for each candidate in candidates
        NStore->>Euclid: distance(query, &candidate.genes)
        Euclid-->>NStore: distance f64
    end
    NStore->>NStore: sort candidates ascending by Euclidean distance
    NStore->>NStore: take top k candidates
    NStore-->>Caller: Ok(Vec<GenePayload>)
